cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mechanism-Resolving Observation Design, please cite the software and associated methods manuscript."
title: "Mechanism-Resolving Observation Design"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Ruiqi
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zuizui0223/mrod"
abstract: >-
  Mechanism-Resolving Observation Design retains ecological mechanism programs
  compatible with declared observations and constraints, quantifies residual
  mechanism ambiguity, and prioritises candidate measurements by normalized
  mechanism-observation mutual information with sequential recomputation after
  each realised observation.
keywords:
  - mechanism inference
  - mechanistic ambiguity
  - ecological models
  - mutual information
  - sequential design
  - observation design
